    <string name="disclosure_title">About the blocker service</string>
    <string name="disclosure_what">TikStop uses an accessibility service to notice when an app you chose to block comes to the front, and covers it with the block screen.</string>
    <string name="disclosure_not">It only looks at which app is open. It doesn\'t read what\'s on screen or what you type, and it sends nothing anywhere.</string>
