    <string name="onboarding_stopping_tag">Tap \u201c%1$s\u201d again. Blocking stops straight away.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_stopping_without">No tag at hand? Choose Unlock now in the app or on the block screen, and wait for a countdown to finish. Leaving the screen stops the countdown, but your block list stays active.</string>
